### assignment of a command name piped into grep
listing=ls | grep conf
>>> SC2034 1:1
>>> SC2036 1:1
>>> SC2209 1:1

### assignment with a redirection piped into a filter
report=summary >/dev/null | sort
>>> SC2034 1:1
>>> SC2036 1:1
>>> SC2260 1:16

### prefix assignment before a real command is fine
LC_ALL=C ls | grep conf
>>> SC2010 1:10

### standalone assignment outside a pipeline is fine
listing=ls
>>> SC2034 1:1
>>> SC2209 1:1

### assignment in a later stage is not inspected
printf '%s\n' a b | marker=seen
>>> SC2034 1:21
